#: ../plugins/auto.rst:3 0978c7effb3941488eff014134a6c900
msgid "Auto"
msgstr "Samodejno"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:5 692dd862b23c4fc28010f3581167e481
msgid ""
"This plugin provides vehicles management for automobile clubs, you can "
"manage:"
msgstr ""
"Ta vtičnik omogoča upravljanje vozil za avtomobilske klube, upravljate lahko:"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:7 d8b8e4b2fc4447d79ca9ca51f3bf5067
msgid "vehicles (owner, several information, photo, etc),"
msgstr "vozila (lastnik, več informacij, fotografija itd.),"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:8 22a5c4546b78406ebc399fade349aad5
msgid "vehicle history modification (owner, color, ...),"
msgstr "sprememba zgodovine vozila (lastnik, barva, ...),"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:9 34f6b5c1c2fc4c62a81b2c00e063f0fd
msgid "brands,"
msgstr "blagovne znamke,"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:10 b9aac2f7cf1a4689a01637cf7fa9808d
msgid "models,"
msgstr "modeli,"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:11 8d454e2e234b4758a4ca945674767b02
msgid "transmission types,"
msgstr "vrste prenosov,"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:12 6415febb780343e39f73881a68d813fe
msgid "body types,"
msgstr "tipi telesa,"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:13 14370d79ee8e41bbb133dbfd28fdbdf3
msgid "colors,"
msgstr "barve,"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:14 5332581ab8d4478ebbd6f1d1b6d452d4
msgid "finitions,"
msgstr "sklepi,"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:15 dc7d3665a278468d95f34abe47a23c0a
msgid "states."
msgstr "države."

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:17 be0e9efc86db48839b6953d910b5c19b
msgid ""
"This plugin has been initially developed in collaboration with Anatole from "
"`Club 404 <https://www.leclub404.com/>`_, and François from `club Fiat 500 "
"<http://www.club500.fr/>`_. A big thanks to them for their precious help "
"during plugin development :)"
msgstr ""
"Ta vtičnik je bil prvotno razvit v sodelovanju z Anatolejem iz kluba `Club "
"404 <https://www.leclub404.com/>`_ in Françoisom iz kluba `club Fiat 500 "
"<http://www.club500.fr/>`_. Velika zahvala za dragoceno pomoč med razvojem "
"vtičnika :)"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:20 4f94cc46b6ea401f8ec0b80ff9b1c1c3
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Namestitev"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:22 0e04f3d42dbe4289924c666d597d1120
msgid "First of all, download the plugin:"
msgstr "Najprej prenesite vtičnik:"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:24 f0f67ee2c3484d3e941b22d24340fef1
msgid "Get latest Auto plugin!"
msgstr "Pridobite najnovejši vtičnik Auto!"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:28 5a0f0ae6cbc74b8aba1ee4d7d0ba55ee
msgid "Get Auto plugin nightly build!"
msgstr "Pridobite samodejno gradnjo vtičnika vsako noč!"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:33 dad1ca775538446898c294c1e39488a6
msgid ""
"Extract the downloaded archive in Galette ``plugins`` directory. For "
"example, under linux (replacing `{url}` and `{version}` with correct values):"
msgstr ""
"Razširite prenesen arhiv v imenik Galette ``plugins``. Na primer v Linuxu "
"(zamenjajte `{url}` in `{version}` s pravilnimi vrednostmi):"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:43 5a91c58304114dadb740d910a745526e
msgid "Database initialisation"
msgstr "Inicializacija baze podatkov"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:45 a6b6b3721ed3494b9f18e0855c5c3790
msgid ""
"In order to work, this plugin requires several tables in the database. "
"See :ref:`Galette plugins management interface <plugins_managment>`."
msgstr ""
"Za delovanje ta vtičnik potrebuje več tabel v bazi podatkov. "
"Glejte :ref:`Vmesnik za upravljanje vtičnikov Galette <plugins_managment>`."

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:47 d6d740ee1527415fbadb2c083e5dca87
msgid "And this is finished; Auto plugin is installed :)"
msgstr "In to je končano; vtičnik Auto je nameščen :)"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:49 e7a4c9d22d204b3ca8aee3e43db9d284
msgid ""
"There is no particular setup required, you can just enter data in the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Ni potrebna posebna nastavitev, podatke lahko le vnesete v bazo podatkov."

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:52 ce679656cc144eb0a3bf8d1925acfadf
msgid "Configure required fields"
msgstr "Konfigurirajte obvezna polja"

#: ../plugins/auto.rst:54 c543719a14844fa594479ad834f2655d
msgid ""
"When adding a new vehicle in database, there are several fields that are "
"required, but that may not fit your needs. In such case, you can define your "
"own required fields: just create a ``local_auto_required.inc.php`` file in "
"your Galette ``config`` directory and declare an array of the fields you "
"want to require. As example, if you just want to require name and model for "
"a car, you will need:"
msgstr ""
"Pri dodajanju novega vozila v podatkovno bazo je potrebnih več polj, ki pa "
"morda ne ustrezajo vašim potrebam. V takem primeru lahko definirate svoja "
"lastna obvezna polja: preprosto ustvarite datoteko "
"``local_auto_required.inc.php`` v imeniku ``config`` v Galette in "
"deklarirajte polje s polji, ki jih želite zahtevati. Na primer, če želite "
"zahtevati le ime in model avtomobila, boste potrebovali:"
